            Paragraph(Text("The factorial normalization is classical symmetric/Bargmann Fock normalization, not a literature novelty claim. AssessedProvenance.FromRepo below refers to the transported formal proof source and its Mathlib reuse, not authorship of the classical normalization. No external literature search was authorized here. Mathlib supplies monomial bases, basis rescaling, partial derivatives, finite-support products and the standard l2 Hilbert basis.")),
            Paragraph(Text("The retained substantive theorem is the all-polynomial creation/derivative pairing. Other retained theorem declarations organize its proof or the positive Core construction and have exact current source consumers; they are not claimed as separate new mathematical results. Unused applications, forwarding aliases and boundary checks are absent from this canonical module.")),
            Node("Occupation", "Occupation indices",
